[PrintTextModified Text:在玄关大厅，<br>看守从玄关方向突然出现。|#0201Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:异形怪物就在眼前，<br>我身体瞬间僵硬起来，不由得停下脚步。|#0201Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆一章より強気の反抗

[PrintTextModified Text:你这混蛋，恶心死了放开我！|#0201Adv07_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆一章より強気の反抗

[PrintTextModified Text:可别小看我啊！？<br>当心我弄死你！！|#0201Adv07_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:紫藤亚里沙被看守扛了起来，<br>正在挥动四肢拼命挣扎。|#0201Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我和亚里沙对上了视线。|#0201Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看、看什么看！你那是什么眼神！<br>你小子给我记住了！！|#0201Adv07_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv07_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Hiro Lazy:false

; さらさらと紙にペンを走らせる書き音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_111 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我默默拿出笔记本，<br>飞快记下几笔。|#0201Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（典型的不良少女，还有改造的余地）|#0201Adv07_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Front LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

; 足音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_97 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:看守把亚里沙拖到了地下层。|#0201Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（她还想做逃跑这种愚蠢的事）|#0201Adv07_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:按照规则，<br>在规定的放风时间之外走出监牢的人，<br>会被关进惩罚室。|#0201Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这就是为什么不遵守规则的人令人厌烦）|#0201Adv07_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:无语地叹了口气。<br>我不再多想这件事，继续向食堂走去。|#0201Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

