[PrintTextModified Text:我站在食堂入口，<br>逐个指着陆续进来的少女们开始点数。|#0201Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:……橘雪莉、远野汉娜，OK。|#0201Adv07_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.2 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:莲见蕾雅、佐伯米莉亚、宝生玛格，OK。|#0201Adv07_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上梅露露、樱羽艾玛、泽渡可可，可以进去了。|#0201Adv07_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:喂喂，她那是把自己当什么人了啊？|#0201Adv07_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我想，希罗大概是在点名吧……|#0201Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:点什么鬼名啦。|#0201Adv07_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:黑部奈叶香、夏目安安……就没人了吗？|#0201Adv07_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我看向入口，<br>似乎不会再有人进来了。|#0201Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才我有看到，紫藤亚里沙被关进惩罚室了。<br>那么现在还少一个人。|#0201Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:城崎诺亚去哪了？|#0201Adv07_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，城崎诺亚说她不吃饭了。|#0201Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……是吗。|#0201Adv07_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:既然不来那也没办法。<br>我环视一圈聚集在食堂的少女们。|#0201Adv07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都是初次来到食堂，都一样感到困惑。<br>当然，我也是第一次来，但已经调查好各种信息了。|#0201Adv07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这边的取餐处上摆放着食物，<br>大家自行取餐就好。|#0201Adv07_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然卖相不佳，但我已经提前试毒了。<br>没有混入奇怪的东西。可以放心食用。|#0201Adv07_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:所以你到底当自己是谁啊？校长吗你。|#0201Adv07_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，还有座位似乎没有特别规定，<br>可以随意就座。|#0201Adv07_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:除了我和艾玛，其他人都是第一次见面。|#0201Adv07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才听完典狱长的讲话后，<br>大家也没怎么聊天，<br>就回到了标有各自囚犯编号的房间。|#0201Adv07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过她们似乎凭直觉感受到了彼此的气场，<br>大家自然而然三三两两地聚集起来。|#0201Adv07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我迅速取了食物，独自坐下。<br>这时——|#0201Adv07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 机にトレイを置く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_112 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:可以坐你旁边吗？|#0201Adv07_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅面带柔和的微笑，<br>在我旁边放下托盘。|#0201Adv07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:无所谓。你看起来还算个能沟通的人。|#0201Adv07_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我大致能猜到蕾雅<br>为什么会来我这里。|#0201Adv07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅和我一样，她也具有团队领头人的气质，<br>大概是在警惕我这个属性相近的人吧。|#0201Adv07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过是首领互争地盘而已。<br>这种情况我经历过几次。|#0201Adv07_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，还有一个意想不到的人<br>也坐到了我旁边。|#0201Adv07_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是黑部奈叶香。|#0201Adv07_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:我也要坐在这里吃。行吗？|#0201Adv07_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:行，请便。|#0201Adv07_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香并没有开始用餐，<br>而是用阴沉的眼神紧盯着我。|#0201Adv07_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（是在怀疑我吗……有意思）|#0201Adv07_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我故意不理会她的视线，<br>优雅地开始用餐。|#0201Adv07_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……这味道真够呛的。<br>你居然能面不改色地吃下去。|#0201Adv07_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:无论味道多么糟糕，都不应该表现在脸上，这样有失礼节。|#0201Adv07_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，确实，你说得对。抱歉。|#0201Adv07_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，希罗，<br>你对这座监牢有什么看法？|#0201Adv07_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有没有什么逃脱的方法呢？|#0201Adv07_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:看守比你想像的要危险得多。<br>不应该违抗它们。|#0201Adv07_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应该优先掌握<br>关于这座监牢和魔女的知识。<br>啊，还有一点。|#0201Adv07_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我习惯在用餐时保持安静。<br>请不要向我搭话。|#0201Adv07_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

