[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv07_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:冷清的餐桌上，<br>我们三人沉默着进食。|#0201Adv07_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边往嘴里送着浓稠的饭菜，<br>一边用余光迅速观察着各个座位。|#0201Adv07_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

