[PrintTextModified Text:——艾玛和雪莉、汉娜坐在一起。|#0201Adv07_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在彼此之间互相试探的<br>尴尬氛围中——|#0201Adv07_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:突然，<br>汉娜站了起来。|#0201Adv07_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是我的魔法哇哇哇～|#0201Adv07_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionY:70|65|70 Duration:1|0.5|3

[PrintTextModified Text:话音刚落，<br>她的身体就轻飘飘地浮了起来。|#0201Adv07_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然只有大约10厘米高，<br>但亲眼目睹她确实飘浮在空中，<br>她口中的【魔法】一词顿时具有了说服力。|#0201Adv07_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来如此。<br>　远野汉娜拥有【飘浮】魔法）|#0201Adv07_Hiro022|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

