[PrintTextModified Text:我迅速扫视了一圈所有人的表情。|#0201Adv07_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然有几个少女显得很惊讶，<br>但看起来，几乎所有人都接受了魔法的存在。|#0201Adv07_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然也包括我在内。|#0201Adv07_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是魔法展示会吗！<br>那么我也要来一个厉害的！|#0201Adv07_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎受到刺激，雪莉一边宣布着，一边站了起来。<br>她拿起托盘上的苹果——|#0201Adv07_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

