[PrintTextModified Text:大家也来展示自己的魔法吧～！|#0201Adv07_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，没有人回应雪莉的提议。<br>所有人都不发一言。|#0201Adv07_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不能使用魔法。因为我不是魔女。|#0201Adv07_Hiro023| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是这样啊……|#0201Adv07_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉垂头丧气地回到座位上，<br>这时我站了起来。|#0201Adv07_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我吃好了。|#0201Adv07_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
[PrintTextModified Text:说完，我走向取餐处，<br>开始往盘子里盛食物。|#0201Adv07_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你不是已经吃完了吗？|#0201Adv07_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，这不是我的。<br>是给城崎诺亚的。|#0201Adv07_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……原来如此。|#0201Adv07_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅轻轻一笑。|#0201Adv07_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你真是个体贴的人啊。|#0201Adv07_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（……体贴？我吗？）|#0201Adv07_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我差点冷哼一声。<br>我只是想保持自己的正确而已。|#0201Adv07_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（城崎诺亚没有来吃饭。<br>　人应该要吃饭。仅此而已）|#0201Adv07_Hiro027|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我端着盛好食物的托盘，<br>离开了食堂。|#0201Adv07_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

